# Islands Architecture

## Principle
Use Astro Islands for interactive components only. Keep pages mostly static.

## Guidelines
- Default components to static rendering
- Mark interactive components with `client:load`, `client:idle`, `client:visible` as needed
- Avoid hydration on pages without user interaction
- Split large islands into smaller units

## Anti-pattern
Hydrating entire page components unnecessarily.

## Example
```astro
---
// Static content renders at build time
---
<IslandComponent client:visible />
```
